---
description: TypeScript and React code style
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript + React

- `import type { X }` inline type imports (`consistent-type-imports`).
- `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`: handle `T | undefined` from indexing explicitly.
- No `any` without justification; no non-null assertion without a comment.
- `simple-import-sort` order: side-effect → `react`/`next` → `@/` →
  relative → CSS. Run `yarn lint-fix`, don't hand-sort.
- `prefer-const`, `no-var`, arrow callbacks, template literals; `_`-prefix
  intentionally unused args (`argsIgnorePattern: ^_`).
